# Kerala Camp Check — web app configuration.
#
# Only VITE_-prefixed variables reach the browser bundle. Never put a
# service-role key or a database URL here — everything in this file is public.

# Where the FastAPI service lives, including the /api/v1 prefix.
# Leave unset for local development: vite.config.ts proxies /api to
# http://127.0.0.1:8000, so the browser stays same-origin and needs no CORS.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://view-flood.onrender.com/api/v1
